---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '~/config/site';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '~/lib/schema';
import ImageSlot from '~/components/ImageSlot.astro';

const breadcrumb = breadcrumbSchema([
  { name: 'Home',      url: SITE.url + '/' },
  { name: 'About',     url: SITE.url + '/about' },
  { name: 'Our Story', url: SITE.url + '/our-story' },
]);
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Our Story — CMGT | People First, Learned the Hard Way"
  description="The CMGT story — from one community in Denham Springs in 2007 to 400+ across five states, a flood that built our culture, and a people-first turn."
  pageSchema={breadcrumb}
>
  <nav id="site-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-crumbs='[{"t":"Home","href":"/"},{"t":"About","href":"/about"},{"t":"Our Story"}]'></nav>

  <!-- HERO — editorial opening spread -->
  <section class="story-hero">
    <div class="container story-hero-top">
      <div class="eyebrow">Our story · Since 2007</div>
      <h1 class="story-hero-display">People first — <em>learned the hard way.</em></h1>
      <div class="story-hero-rule"></div>
      <p class="story-hero-lede">
        Nineteen years, five states, and 400+ communities — all of it started with an HOA
        assessment notice on a friend's kitchen counter and four words Jeff Harman would
        eat: <strong>“you couldn't pay me to do that.”</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="story-hero-band">
      <ImageSlot src="/photos/story-hero-photo.webp" alt="A founding-era Gulf South community at golden hour — manicured streetscape with live oaks" shape="rect" />
      <div class="quote-over">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="story-hero-origin">“Well, actually <span class="g">— you could pay me to do that.”</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CHAPTERS -->
  <section class="chapters">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="chapter reveal">
        <div class="chapter-marker">
          <div class="chapter-num">01</div>
          <div class="chapter-label">The accidental beginning</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="chapter-h">It started with a letter on a kitchen counter.</h2>
          <p class="chapter-p">
            Jeff Harman was running a financial counseling firm with his dad when he stopped by
            a friend's house before dinner. A letter from the HOA was sitting on the counter.
            He asked about it.
          </p>
          <p class="chapter-p">
            His friend explained: neighbors volunteering their evenings and weekends to enforce
            rules, collect assessments, and keep the community running. For free. Because
            somebody had to.
          </p>
          <p class="chapter-p">
            Jeff's first thought was that <strong>nobody should have to do that work for free.</strong>
            His second thought was that somebody could build a company to take it off their plates.
            He went home, talked to a few buddies who'd been wanting to build something together,
            and they set a goal: <strong>sixty communities.</strong> That was the plan.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="chapter reveal">
        <div class="chapter-marker">
          <div class="chapter-num">02</div>
          <div class="chapter-label">The order of the P's</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="chapter-h">Process. Product. Profit. People — in that order. That was the mistake.</h2>
          <p class="chapter-p">
            The first version of the company was built on systems: tight processes, a solid
            product, healthy margins. And for five or six years, it worked. But somewhere in
            that order, the people doing the work came last — and good people started moving on.
          </p>
          <p class="chapter-p">
            The fix wasn't a new process. It was a mirror. Jeff flipped the order:
            <strong>people first</strong> — hire great people, give them great tools, pour into
            them, and they'll make the processes great, which makes the product great.
            <em>That's still how CMGT runs today.</em>
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PULL QUOTE -->
  <section class="pull">
    <div class="leaf" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/leaf-mark.svg" alt=""></div>
    <div class="container pull-in reveal">
      <blockquote class="pull-q" style="margin-left:0; margin-right:0;">
        "If I had to say what my company should be known for, I would say: <span class="g">the company
        that takes care of its people</span> — because then they will be inspired to take care of
        everyone else."
      </blockquote>
      <div class="pull-attr"><strong>Jeff Harman</strong> · Founder & CEO</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FLOOD -->
  <section class="flood">
    <div class="container flood-grid">
      <div class="flood-media reveal">
        <ImageSlot src="/photos/flood-photo.webp" alt="A Denham Springs community showing resilience after the 2016 flood" shape="rounded" radius={20} />
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-blue">2016 · Denham Springs</div>
        <h2 class="flood-h">The flood that proved <em>who we were.</em></h2>
        <p class="flood-p">
          In August 2016, the Great Flood put most of Denham Springs underwater. Two feet of water
          filled CMGT's office. Team members' homes flooded. Jeff's own house did too. So did
          communities we managed.
        </p>
        <p class="flood-p">
          With about thirty team members and no office, CMGT went fully remote overnight —
          and the service didn't slip. <strong>The flood taught us our culture didn't live in a
          building.</strong> When a developer client said "we're expanding into Mississippi,
          we want you to come," the answer was easy. That was the first state line — the
          beginning of today's five-state footprint.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="flood-quote" style="margin-left:0; margin-right:0;">
          "It really clicked at the time of the flood that we could really do this."
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TIMELINE -->
  <section class="timeline">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-blue reveal">Nineteen years, still counting</div>
      <h2 class="tl-h reveal">Greatness isn't a destination. <span class="u">It's a journey.</span></h2>
      <div class="tl-grid">
        <div class="tl-item reveal">
          <div class="tl-year">2007</div>
          <div class="tl-t">One community, one team member</div>
          <p class="tl-d">CMGT manages its first association in Denham Springs, Louisiana — a side project with a sixty-community plan.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item reveal">
          <div class="tl-year">2012</div>
          <div class="tl-t">CMGT Cares begins</div>
          <p class="tl-d">The community giving program starts — because managing communities means caring about more than the grass.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item reveal">
          <div class="tl-year">2014</div>
          <div class="tl-t">Largest in Louisiana</div>
          <p class="tl-d">CMGT becomes the state's largest HOA management company — every community won by referral and reputation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item reveal">
          <div class="tl-year">2016</div>
          <div class="tl-t">The flood — and the leap</div>
          <p class="tl-d">The Great Flood forces a fully remote model that sticks. A developer's invitation carries CMGT into Mississippi.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item reveal">
          <div class="tl-year">2021</div>
          <div class="tl-t">Largest on the Mississippi Gulf Coast</div>
          <p class="tl-d">Five years in Mississippi, and CMGT becomes the largest manager on the Gulf Coast — neighbors there, not outsiders.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item reveal">
          <div class="tl-year">2026</div>
          <div class="tl-t">CMGT, fully realized</div>
          <p class="tl-d">A full rebrand for a five-state team serving 400+ communities and 60,000+ homes — independently owned since day one.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GREYHOUND -->
  <section class="grey">
    <div class="container grey-in">
      <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-blue reveal">The Greyhound Mentality</div>
      <h2 class="grey-h reveal">The joy was never in the capture. It's in the chase.</h2>
      <p class="grey-p reveal">
        Jeff's father taught him this at the greyhound races: the dogs chase the same stuffed
        rabbit every day. They never catch it. And they come back the next day and run just as
        hard. Their joy isn't in the capture — <strong>it's in the chase.</strong>
      </p>
      <p class="grey-p reveal">
        That's how CMGT runs. The only constant here is that things are always changing, always
        improving. No complacency, no "we've arrived" — just a team that comes back every day
        and runs hard.
      </p>
      <p class="grey-tag reveal">Take what you do seriously. <span class="g">Never take yourself seriously.</span></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LEADERSHIP -->
  <section class="lead">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="lead-top">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-blue">Leadership</div>
          <h2 class="lead-h">No face on the building. A team behind every community.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <p class="lead-p">
            CMGT is ~91 people across five states — remote-first, Gulf South-rooted, and built
            on a team-based model where no community ever depends on a single person.
          </p>
          <a class="lead-link" href="/team-and-careers">Meet the whole team <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lead-grid">
        <div class="lead-card reveal">
          <ImageSlot src="/photos/lead-jeff.webp" alt="Jeff Harman, Founder & CEO" shape="circle" />
          <div class="lead-name">Jeff Harman</div>
          <div class="lead-role">Founder & CEO</div>
        </div>
        <div class="lead-card reveal">
          <ImageSlot src="/photos/our-story-lead-amanda.jpg" alt="Amanda Betancourt, Chief Operating Officer" shape="circle" />
          <div class="lead-name">Amanda Betancourt</div>
          <div class="lead-role">Chief Operating Officer</div>
        </div>
        <div class="lead-card reveal">
          <ImageSlot src="/photos/our-story-lead-ashley.jpg" alt="Ashley Melancon, Chief Financial Officer" shape="circle" />
          <div class="lead-name">Ashley Melancon</div>
          <div class="lead-role">Chief Financial Officer</div>
        </div>
        <div class="lead-card reveal">
          <ImageSlot src="/photos/our-story-lead-chris.jpg" alt="Chris Tremblay, Chief Real Estate Officer" shape="circle" />
          <div class="lead-name">Chris Tremblay</div>
          <div class="lead-role">Chief Real Estate Officer</div>
        </div>
        <div class="lead-card reveal">
          <ImageSlot src="/photos/our-story-lead-hannah.jpg" alt="Hannah Daigle, Head of HR" shape="circle" />
          <div class="lead-name">Hannah Daigle</div>
          <div class="lead-role">Head of HR</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STATS STRIP -->
  <section class="strip">
    <div class="container strip-grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="strip-num" data-count-to="2007" data-plain data-duration="1600">0</div>
        <div class="strip-label">founded in Denham Springs</div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="strip-num" data-count-to="400" data-suffix="+" data-duration="1500">0+</div>
        <div class="strip-label">communities managed</div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="strip-num" data-count-to="5" data-duration="900">0</div>
        <div class="strip-label">states, neighbors in every one</div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="strip-num" data-count-to="96" data-suffix="%" data-duration="1600">0%</div>
        <div class="strip-label">client retention</div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="strip-num" data-count-to="100" data-suffix="%" data-duration="1400">0%</div>
        <div class="strip-label">organic growth — no PE, ever</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta">
    <div class="leaf" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/leaf-mark.svg" alt=""></div>
    <div class="container cta-in reveal">
      <h2 class="cta-h">Nineteen years in. <em>Still chasing.</em></h2>
      <p class="cta-p">If your community deserves a team that runs this hard, let's have a conversation — no pitch deck, no pressure.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-green" href="/request-a-proposal">Request a proposal <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="tel:2255032648">Call (225) 503-2648</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Our Story — editorial split language ───────────────────── */
  body { background: #fff; }
  .eyebrow-blue { color: var(--freedom-blue); opacity: .6; }

  /* HERO — editorial opening spread (distinct from home) */
  .story-hero {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--freedom-blue);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 120px 0 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    isolation: isolate;
  }
  .story-hero::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 8%, rgba(141,189,255,.12) 0%, transparent 55%);
    z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .story-hero-top { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding-bottom: 64px; }
  .story-hero .eyebrow { color: rgba(255,255,255,.62); }
  .story-hero-display {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 104px);
    line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.03em;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .story-hero-display em { font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; color: var(--landscaping-green); }
  .story-hero-rule { width: 88px; height: 5px; background: var(--landscaping-green); border-radius: 3px; margin: 36px 0 32px; }
  .story-hero-lede {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 22px); line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
    max-width: 680px; margin: 0;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .story-hero-lede strong { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
  /* full-bleed cinematic image band with overlaid origin quote */
  .story-hero-band { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .story-hero-band :global(.image-slot) { display: block; width: 100%; height: clamp(340px, 42vw, 560px); border-radius: 0; }
  .story-hero-band .quote-over {
    position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    padding: 64px 0 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(21,21,92,.82) 0%, rgba(21,21,92,.4) 55%, transparent 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .story-hero-band .quote-over .container { pointer-events: auto; }
  .story-hero-origin {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 34px); line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -.01em;
    color: #fff; max-width: 760px; margin: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .story-hero-origin .g { color: var(--landscaping-green); }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .story-hero { padding-top: 92px; } }

  /* CHAPTERS */
  .chapters { background: #fff; padding: 40px 0 90px; }
  .chapter {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr;
    gap: 56px;
    padding: 54px 0;
    border-top: 1.5px solid var(--hairline-strong);
    max-width: 1020px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .chapter { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; } }
  .chapter-marker { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .chapter-num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1; color: var(--landscaping-green); }
  .chapter-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-400); }
  .chapter-h {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.015em;
    color: var(--freedom-blue);
    margin: 0 0 18px; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .chapter-p { font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--ink-500); margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 620px; }
  .chapter-p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .chapter-p strong { color: var(--freedom-blue); font-weight: 600; }
  .chapter-p em { font-style: italic; }

  /* PULL QUOTE */
  .pull { background: var(--freedom-blue); color: #fff; padding: 110px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .pull .leaf { position: absolute; right: -110px; top: -130px; width: 480px; height: 480px; opacity: .07; transform: rotate(-10deg); pointer-events: none; }
  .pull .leaf img { filter: brightness(0) invert(1); }
  .pull-in { position: relative; max-width: 920px; }
  .pull-q {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 44px); line-height: 1.28; letter-spacing: -.01em;
    color: #fff; margin: 0 0 28px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .pull-q .g { color: var(--landscaping-green); font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; }
  .pull-attr { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.65); }
  .pull-attr strong { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }

  /* FLOOD BAND */
  .flood { background: var(--nb-lightest); padding: 110px 0; }
  .flood-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .95fr 1.05fr; gap: 72px; align-items: center; }
  @media (max-width: 980px) { .flood-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 44px; } }
  .flood-media :global(.image-slot) { width: 100%; height: 460px; }
  .flood-h {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 44px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.015em;
    color: var(--freedom-blue); margin: 16px 0 20px; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .flood-h em { font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; }
  .flood-p { font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--ink-500); margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 540px; }
  .flood-p strong { color: var(--freedom-blue); font-weight: 600; }
  .flood-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal;
    font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--freedom-blue);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--landscaping-green);
    padding-left: 20px; margin: 24px 0 0;
  }

  /* TIMELINE */
  .timeline { background: #fff; padding: 120px 0 100px; }
  .tl-h {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.015em;
    color: var(--freedom-blue); max-width: 700px;
    margin: 18px 0 64px; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .tl-h .u { background: linear-gradient(transparent 78%, var(--landscaping-green) 78%); padding-bottom: .04em; }
  .tl-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 0 48px; }
  @media (max-width: 980px) { .tl-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .tl-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .tl-item { border-top: 1.5px solid var(--hairline-strong); padding: 22px 2px 36px; transition: border-color var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out); }
  .tl-item:hover { border-top-color: var(--landscaping-green); }
  .tl-year { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 34px; color: var(--landscaping-green); line-height: 1; }
  .tl-t { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; color: var(--freedom-blue); margin: 12px 0 8px; line-height: 1.25; }
  .tl-d { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-500); margin: 0; }

  /* GREYHOUND */
  .grey { background: var(--fb-lightest); padding: 110px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .grey-in { max-width: 860px; }
  .grey-h {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 44px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.015em;
    color: var(--freedom-blue); margin: 16px 0 22px; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .grey-p { font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--ink-700); margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 680px; }
  .grey-p strong { color: var(--freedom-blue); font-weight: 600; }
  .grey-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 32px); color: var(--freedom-blue);
    margin: 30px 0 0;
  }
  .grey-tag .g { color: inherit; background: linear-gradient(transparent 76%, var(--landscaping-green) 76%); font-style: italic; }

  /* LEADERSHIP */
  .lead { background: #fff; padding: 120px 0 100px; }
  .lead-top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 72px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 56px; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .lead-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; } }
  .lead-h {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 44px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.015em;
    color: var(--freedom-blue); margin: 16px 0 0; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .lead-p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-500); margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .lead-link {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; color: var(--freedom-blue); text-decoration: none;
  }
  .lead-link .arrow { color: var(--landscaping-green); transition: transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out); }
  .lead-link:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }
  .lead-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 36px 28px; }
  @media (max-width: 980px) { .lead-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .lead-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  .lead-card { text-align: center; }
  .lead-card :global(.image-slot) { width: 132px; height: 132px; margin: 0 auto 16px; }
  .lead-name { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: var(--freedom-blue); }
  .lead-role { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-400); margin-top: 3px; }

  /* STATS STRIP */
  .strip { background: var(--landscaping-green); color: var(--freedom-blue); padding: 44px 0; }
  .strip-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 28px; }
  @media (max-width: 980px) { .strip-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .strip-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .strip-num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  .strip-label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 6px; color: rgba(30,30,119,.78); }

  /* CTA */
  .cta { background: var(--freedom-blue); color: #fff; padding: 110px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .cta .leaf { position: absolute; right: -80px; top: -90px; width: 420px; height: 420px; opacity: .08; transform: rotate(-12deg); pointer-events: none; }
  .cta .leaf img { filter: brightness(0) invert(1); }
  .cta-in { position: relative; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cta-h {
